### Register
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sagar", "email": "test@test.com", "password": "password123" }

###  Login — copy the refreshToken from response
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@test.com", "password": "password123" }

### Refresh — paste refreshToken from login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "." }

### Logout
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "." }

### 1. Login first — get accessToken
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@test.com", "password": "password123" }

### 2. Valid token — should return user data
GET http://localhost:3000/api/test/profile
Authorization: Bearer 

### 3. No token — should return 401 "No token provided"
GET http://localhost:3000/api/test/profile

### 4. Garbage token — should return 401 "Not authorized, token failed"
GET http://localhost:3000/api/test/profile
Authorization: Bearer thisisnotavalidtoken

### 5. Expired token — should return 401 "Not authorized, token failed"
# To test this: temporarily change JWT_ACCESS_EXPIRES to "1s" in .env,
# restart server, login, wait 2 seconds, then hit the route
GET http://localhost:3000/api/test/profile
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_1S_EXPIRY_TEST

### HOLDINGS TEST 
### 1. Login — get accessToken
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@test.com", "password": "password123" }

### 2. Create holding
POST http://localhost:3000/api/holdings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjZhMDk1MjA5M2Q2MGNmMmQ2NDMyNDRjNyIsImlhdCI6MTc3OTAxNzk4NiwiZXhwIjoxNzc5MDE4NTg2fQ.r-j5oZRR8lp4dQqLs6KUTKO8wOrBBVdJdmCQYJ_PT60

{
  "platform": "CommBank",
  "exchange": "ASX",
  "currency": "AUD",
  "ticker": "CBA",
  "name": "Commonwealth Bank",
  "qty": 10,
  "buyPrice": 120.50,
  "purchaseDate": "2024-01-15",
  "isFreeAllotment": false,
  "isTracking": true,
  "notes": "First holding"
}

### 3. Get all holdings
GET http://localhost:3000/api/holdings
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjZhMDk1MjA5M2Q2MGNmMmQ2NDMyNDRjNyIsImlhdCI6MTc3OTAxNzk4NiwiZXhwIjoxNzc5MDE4NTg2fQ.r-j5oZRR8lp4dQqLs6KUTKO8wOrBBVdJdmCQYJ_PT60

### 4. Get single holding — paste _id from response above
GET http://localhost:3000/api/holdings/6a0958323dea954057170410
Authorization: BearereyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjZhMDk1MjA5M2Q2MGNmMmQ2NDMyNDRjNyIsImlhdCI6MTc3OTAxNzk4NiwiZXhwIjoxNzc5MDE4NTg2fQ.r-j5oZRR8lp4dQqLs6KUTKO8wOrBBVdJdmCQYJ_PT60

### 5. Update holding
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/holdings/6a0958323dea954057170410
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer.

{
  "qty": 15,
  "notes": "Topped up"
}

### 6. Delete holding
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/holdings/6a0958323dea954057170410
Authorization: Bearer.

